   "detailed_description": "<h1>Join our Discord!</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139460/extras/31ea786f1b3e4888cadc1fda1ce338dd.avif?t=1792202672\" width=616 height=130 /></span></p><br><h1>關於此遊戲</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>星球隕落，你是荒野中的求生者</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >你在一片荒野中醒來，饑渴難耐，周遭的瓜果與流水觸手可及，卻隱現詭異的藍光——這些被星塵汙染的飲食不僅會損害健康，還會使你的理智逐漸崩潰……更多的危險蟄伏在暗處，等待著你力竭倒地後撲上來將你分食。超越者，別讓它們如願。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139460/extras/0b4e45fcad2456b08efd6ffd6a95bcda.poster.avif?t=1792202672\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139460/extras/0b4e45fcad2456b08efd6ffd6a95bcda.webm?t=1792202672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139460/extras/0b4e45fcad2456b08efd6ffd6a95bcda.mp4?t=1792202672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>銀之門洞開，你是挑戰異次元生物的戰士</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >星塵浩劫滋生出難以計量的異變體，這些恐怖的怪物占據了幾乎整個世界。必須從它們手中收復人類的故土！雖然異變體一直將人類視作獵物，但現在，超越者，這世界有了你…該換我們成為獵人了。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139460/extras/9fb19adaf01135b5c74d4545182271aa.poster.avif?t=1792202672\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139460/extras/9fb19adaf01135b5c74d4545182271aa.webm?t=1792202672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139460/extras/9fb19adaf01135b5c74d4545182271aa.mp4?t=1792202672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>火力是末日的唯一真理，你是運用槍械的大師</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7大槍械分類，超100種槍械藍圖等待你收集打造，每一把武器都能給你帶來全新體驗。要是現成的武器無法滿足你的戰鬥欲望，你還可以使用配件來自由改造槍械，並組建你的專屬槍械天賦，讓每一場遭遇戰都成為你多變戰術的檢驗場！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139460/extras/fb837f5127d3dc85caf546f36a7e4a19.poster.avif?t=1792202672\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139460/extras/fb837f5127d3dc85caf546f36a7e4a19.webm?t=1792202672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139460/extras/fb837f5127d3dc85caf546f36a7e4a19.mp4?t=1792202672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>文明傾頹，你是人類文明的重鑄者</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在荒野上，任何一個位置，建造你專屬的家園吧！你可以建造一座極具生存主義風格的城寨：把一切你收集的好東西都塞到金屬墻壁後面，在外圍布滿防禦設施；或者你也可以在確保安全的前提下，建造一所功能齊全的大型生存點：擁有露臺、廚房、車庫……等的大房子！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139460/extras/45c03fae8ce89d9cb0e2e487eb85ccc4.poster.avif?t=1792202672\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139460/extras/45c03fae8ce89d9cb0e2e487eb85ccc4.webm?t=1792202672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139460/extras/45c03fae8ce89d9cb0e2e487eb85ccc4.mp4?t=1792202672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>往日不再，你是世界淪陷真相的探尋者</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在探尋浩劫真相的旅途中，你永遠不是孤身一人。荒野上存在著大大小小的倖存者勢力，有的充滿了暴力和敵意，有些則願意謹慎地與外來者進行接觸。前往倖存者的據點去深入了解他們的故事吧——是在解決威脅當地的異變體後不留姓名地離去？還是討價還價獲得你應得的報酬？選擇權在你手上。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139460/extras/6a93a33aceaa3696addb891058fae574.poster.avif?t=1792202672\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139460/extras/6a93a33aceaa3696addb891058fae574.webm?t=1792202672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139460/extras/6a93a33aceaa3696addb891058fae574.mp4?t=1792202672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
   "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>星球隕落，你是荒野中的求生者</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >你在一片荒野中醒來，饑渴難耐，周遭的瓜果與流水觸手可及，卻隱現詭異的藍光——這些被星塵汙染的飲食不僅會損害健康，還會使你的理智逐漸崩潰……更多的危險蟄伏在暗處，等待著你力竭倒地後撲上來將你分食。超越者，別讓它們如願。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139460/extras/0b4e45fcad2456b08efd6ffd6a95bcda.poster.avif?t=1792202672\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139460/extras/0b4e45fcad2456b08efd6ffd6a95bcda.webm?t=1792202672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139460/extras/0b4e45fcad2456b08efd6ffd6a95bcda.mp4?t=1792202672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>銀之門洞開，你是挑戰異次元生物的戰士</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >星塵浩劫滋生出難以計量的異變體，這些恐怖的怪物占據了幾乎整個世界。必須從它們手中收復人類的故土！雖然異變體一直將人類視作獵物，但現在，超越者，這世界有了你…該換我們成為獵人了。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139460/extras/9fb19adaf01135b5c74d4545182271aa.poster.avif?t=1792202672\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139460/extras/9fb19adaf01135b5c74d4545182271aa.webm?t=1792202672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139460/extras/9fb19adaf01135b5c74d4545182271aa.mp4?t=1792202672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>火力是末日的唯一真理，你是運用槍械的大師</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7大槍械分類，超100種槍械藍圖等待你收集打造，每一把武器都能給你帶來全新體驗。要是現成的武器無法滿足你的戰鬥欲望，你還可以使用配件來自由改造槍械，並組建你的專屬槍械天賦，讓每一場遭遇戰都成為你多變戰術的檢驗場！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139460/extras/fb837f5127d3dc85caf546f36a7e4a19.poster.avif?t=1792202672\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139460/extras/fb837f5127d3dc85caf546f36a7e4a19.webm?t=1792202672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139460/extras/fb837f5127d3dc85caf546f36a7e4a19.mp4?t=1792202672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>文明傾頹，你是人類文明的重鑄者</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在荒野上，任何一個位置，建造你專屬的家園吧！你可以建造一座極具生存主義風格的城寨：把一切你收集的好東西都塞到金屬墻壁後面，在外圍布滿防禦設施；或者你也可以在確保安全的前提下，建造一所功能齊全的大型生存點：擁有露臺、廚房、車庫……等的大房子！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139460/extras/45c03fae8ce89d9cb0e2e487eb85ccc4.poster.avif?t=1792202672\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139460/extras/45c03fae8ce89d9cb0e2e487eb85ccc4.webm?t=1792202672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139460/extras/45c03fae8ce89d9cb0e2e487eb85ccc4.mp4?t=1792202672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>往日不再，你是世界淪陷真相的探尋者</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在探尋浩劫真相的旅途中，你永遠不是孤身一人。荒野上存在著大大小小的倖存者勢力，有的充滿了暴力和敵意，有些則願意謹慎地與外來者進行接觸。前往倖存者的據點去深入了解他們的故事吧——是在解決威脅當地的異變體後不留姓名地離去？還是討價還價獲得你應得的報酬？選擇權在你手上。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139460/extras/6a93a33aceaa3696addb891058fae574.poster.avif?t=1792202672\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com